{"name":"Programs: loader","description":"Test demo: list, download, validate and run signed programs from the host","kind":"programs","entry":"programs.txt","args":["10.0.2.2:7003","03e489240a78d8a85713f5b6d22749632d8268e238c40b9aca99f54c44de11828d"]}This app holds no program. It opens the program loader on the server its
args give, trusting the signer keys of its args: a list of the server's
programs, each of which can be downloaded into the store, validated and
run. See "Loader, lister and runner (#17)" in docs/ProgramDistribution.md.
